---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import Face from '../components/Face.astro'
import SpanCycle from '../components/SpanCycle.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Graham Van Pelt - Software Developer"
  description="Portfolio including Graham Van Pelt's apps and projects"
>
  <div>
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>
        A <em>Software Developer</em>, building for the web with <br />
        <SpanCycle />
      </h1>
      <Face />
    </section>
    <section class="intro">
      <p>
        👋 Hi, I&apos;m Graham, a web developer based on beautiful <strong
          >Salt Spring Island</strong
        > in western Canada. For the past couple of years I&apos;ve worked at <a
          href="https://www.tipbox.io"
          class="serif">Tipbox.io</a
        > as <strong>Full Stack Developer</strong>. We&apos;re building a Task
        Management and Visual File Sharing platform for production teams.
        <br />
        <br />I use <strong>React</strong> with <strong>TypeScript</strong> to build
        satisfying and accessible web experiences. Visit my <a
          href="/portfolio"
          class="serif underlined">portfolio</a
        > or have a look through my <a href="/cv" class="serif underlined">CV</a
        >.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  div {
    padding-inline: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  @media (width >= 48rem) {
    .hero {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-block-end: 4rem;
    }
  }

  h1 {
    min-width: 320px;
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    line-height: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (width >= 48rem) {
    h1 {
      max-width: 20ch;
      font-size: 3rem;
      /* Unitless 1, not a rem value: Tailwind switches to a tight ratio at
         text-5xl and above. */
      line-height: 1;
    }
  }

  h1 em {
    color: var(--colour-accent);
  }

  .intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .intro p {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* font-extrabold had no 800 face declared, so it has been synthesising from
     700 all along. */
  .serif {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .underlined {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
